function TeacherPicker({names,selected,choose,close}:{names:string[];selected:string;choose:(name:string)=>void;close:()=>void}){const [name,setName]=useState(selected||names[0]||'');return <div className="scrim center"><div className="appDialog teacherSelect" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><button className="close" onClick={close}><X/></button><div className="profileMark"><UserRound/></div><small>TEACHER PROFILE</small><h2>Select your name</h2><p>Your allocated classes and reminders will be shown automatically.</p><label>Teacher<select value={name} onChange={e=>setName(e.target.value)}>{names.map(n=><option key={teacherKey(n)} value={n}>{n}</option>)}</select></label><button className="primary" disabled={!name} onClick={()=>choose(name)}>Use this profile</button></div></div>}
function TeacherProfile({name,classes,close,change}:{name:string;classes:ClassItem[];close:()=>void;change:()=>void}){const subjects=[...new Set(classes.map(c=>c.subject))],forms=[...new Set(classes.map(c=>c.room).filter(Boolean))],groups=[...new Map(classes.map(c=>[`${normalize(c.room)}:${normalize(c.subject)}`,{room:c.room||'Class not specified',subject:c.subject}])).values()].sort((a,b)=>a.room.localeCompare(b.room,undefined,{numeric:true})||a.subject.localeCompare(b.subject));return <div className="scrim center"><div className="appDialog profileModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><button className="close" onClick={close}><X/></button><div className="profileMark"><UserRound/></div><small>TEACHER PROFILE</small><h2>{name}</h2><p>{classes.length} weekly period{classes.length===1?'':'s'} • {forms.length} class{forms.length===1?'':'es'} • {subjects.length} subject{subjects.length===1?'':'s'}.</p><div className="subjectList classSubjectList">{groups.map(group=>{const periods=classes.filter(c=>normalize(c.room)===normalize(group.room)&&normalize(c.subject)===normalize(group.subject)).sort((a,b)=>a.day-b.day||a.start.localeCompare(b.start));return <div key={`${group.room}:${group.subject}`}><BookOpen/><span><small className="classLabel">{group.room}</small><b>{group.subject}</b><small>{periods.map(c=>`${days[c.day].slice(0,3)} ${c.start}–${c.end}`).join(' • ')}</small></span></div>})}</div><button className="primary" onClick={change}>Change teacher</button></div></div>}
function AllocationWelcome({upload,limited}:{upload:()=>void;limited:()=>void}){return <div className="scrim center"><div className="appDialog allocationWelcome" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><div className="profileMark"><UserRound/></div><small>SET UP YOUR TEACHER PROFILE</small><h2>Upload subject allocation</h2><p>TimeKeeper uses the allocation to show your name, subjects, classes and reminders. After it is read, select your teacher name.</p><button className="primary" onClick={upload}><Upload/> Upload PDF or Word</button><button className="secondary" onClick={limited}>Continue with limited access</button><small className="privacyNote">You can upload it later in Settings. Marks and private academic tools require an approved account.</small></div></div>}
function Onboarding({finish}:{finish:()=>void}){const [step,setStep]=useState(0);const slides=[{icon:<Upload/>,title:'Import your timetable',text:'Choose a PDF. Master timetables are separated by class automatically.'},{icon:<Bell/>,title:'Never miss a class',text:'Private, on-device reminders work without an internet connection.'},{icon:<Share2/>,title:'Match your teaching schedule',text:'Import the subject allocation, select your teacher name, and see only your classes.'}];const slide=slides[step];return <div className="onboarding" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><div className="onboardBrand"><div className="logo launcherLogo"><img src="/launcher-mark.png" alt=""/></div><b>TimeKeeper <span>Master</span></b></div><div className="onboardVisual">{slide.icon}</div><small>WELCOME • {step+1} OF {slides.length}</small><h1>{slide.title}</h1><p>{slide.text}</p><div className="dots">{slides.map((_,i)=><i className={i===step?'active':''} key={i}/>)}</div><button className="primary" onClick={()=>step<slides.length-1?setStep(step+1):finish()}>{step<slides.length-1?'Continue':'Get started'} <ChevronRight/></button>{step>0&&<button className="back" onClick={()=>setStep(step-1)}>Back</button>}</div>}
function Modal({draft,setDraft,close,add}:{draft:Partial<ClassItem>;setDraft:(x:Partial<ClassItem>)=>void;close:()=>void;add:()=>void}){const field=(k:keyof ClassItem,v:string|number)=>setDraft({...draft,[k]:v});return <div className="scrim"><div className="modal"><button className="close" onClick={close}><X/></button><small>NEW CLASS</small><h2>Add to schedule</h2><label>Subject<input autoFocus value={draft.subject||''} onChange={e=>field('subject',e.target.value)} placeholder="e.g. Mathematics"/></label><div className="grid"><label>Day<select value={draft.day} onChange={e=>field('day',+e.target.value)}>{days.map((d,i)=><option value={i} key={d}>{d}</option>)}</select></label><label>Room<input value={draft.room||''} onChange={e=>field('room',e.target.value)} placeholder="Optional"/></label><label>Starts<input type="time" value={draft.start} onChange={e=>field('start',e.target.value)}/></label><label>Ends<input type="time" value={draft.end} onChange={e=>field('end',e.target.value)}/></label></div><label>Teacher<input value={draft.teacher||''} onChange={e=>field('teacher',e.target.value)} placeholder="Optional"/></label><button className="primary" disabled={!draft.subject} onClick={add}>Add class</button></div></div>}
